{"kind":"request","text":"S4 follow-up: reach the lanes that since and needs_you omit\n\nScope: under ruling 4a276240. With more than six selected lanes, the same lanes stay omitted in a stable order, and since never completes, so Mark reviewed is never offered. A real sprint room will pass six lanes.\n\nDeliver the smallest design and code that lets a person reach every lane and mark what they saw: for example a cursor over the selected lanes, or a mark that covers exactly the displayed heads and moves the selection on. Choose one and say why. Keep the existing scope, request and byte limits for one call, the pure read of since, and the rule that a mark covers only heads that were displayed.\n\nDone when: with nine lanes, repeated calls reach all nine; a mark leaves the lanes it did not display still unreviewed; a call still says what it left out. The checker approves the exact head, and the gate passes.\n\nNot before: S4 lands. Order: after S6, before J1. No new lane acts. If a hosted Worker serves the changed code, the planner deploys after the J4 witness closes.","body":{"conditions":"Done when: with nine lanes repeated calls reach all nine; a mark leaves undisplayed lanes unreviewed; each call says what it left out; checker approves the exact head; gate passes. Not before S4 lands.","stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:4a27624051de6aedf155fb530d09fdedce38300a stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:070231aadcb17348891458bc2eedb5bbf529860c","target_head":"112eff124e7a51d2ebdd2d100ae24b52d03848ac","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}